<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Efesoone</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Efesoone Asuntsis Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesoone</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Efesoone Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Efesoone yeze asuntsis xaafide kiitite ubbappa aatsii bi7idanna, «Wode yellize wode Xoozii folodes qoppide qoftta, salon sa7a yeze medhinttide baz ubbunna Kiristtoosappa oomora maaqqade fana» yagaaze qoftto (1:10). Yinnilla afa gujjii Yesuusa Kiristtoosara yeze fettetitsite, as kochchi ubba fetto maaqqade fana yinna damma qoftto oochalla feeshode fana Xoozze asuntsana qofizane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efesoone kiita tiino kifiltte xaafize omma qofa maaqqize fettetitsi baz xaafodes aykkidanno dalggizii, Xoozze aday fa asuntsi wayzi doorezako, unttin E na7ay, Yesuusa Kiristtoosa fa nagarttippa maarotitsi denggi wayzi wallo kezezakon, Xoozze damma ufays qaala Geeshi ayyaana baggara turo maaqqidanno ernttezako ohine. Lam7intsa kifiltte mahi xaafize hyanna kiitto nabbabize asuntsi fa fettetitsito de7ite Kiristtoosa gidda un yeze fettetitsita turo maaqqade gaar un wayzi yessades beezizako qofizane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asuntsi Kiristtoosa gidda yeze fettetitsito wayzi yessades beezizako dumma dumma aazizer qonccida. Woosa keetstsi galla aazize maaqqize wode Kiristtoosa yinna gallitis omma. Woosa keetstsi gimbbe keetstsara aazize wode Kirsttoosa yinna keetsitis doche xaphito mintsize waanna shuchchi. Woosa keetstsi machchira aazize wode Kiristtoosa azinara aazizane. Xaafize Kiristtoosa baggara qonccide Xoozze anjjo keehatitsito gaama nashshii ohitera, gaatsita genidhize ohe ohine. E ubba baz, Kiristtoosa siiqito, E zharshinttidanno, E inggide nagara maarotitsito, E aadho keehatitsiton E geeshshatitsite baggara be7ine.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Saritse <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosan woosa keetstsi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa gidda yeze kille de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Xoozze qofara Kiristtoos Yesuusa hawaare maaqqide Phawuloosa, Efesoone yeze geeshshuntsisin Kiristtoosa Yesuusa ammanzuntsis xaafinttide kiita.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Xoozze nu Adeppan Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa aadho keehatitsin sarotitsi yinttis maaqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Hawa. 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa gidda yeze ayyaana anjjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Salo yeze ayyaana anjjo ubba Kiristtoosa baggara nuna anjjida, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aday, galatintto. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Nuunii E tiino geeshshuntsanan bore baayzuntsana maaqqode fana Xoozii alame medhinttodannippa tiino Kiristtoosa baggara fa siiqite nuna doorida. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Xoozze fa lo77o qofite fa kadhide gaar Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nuna fa na7untsana mahodes tiino qoppii gaddida. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Xoozze fa siiqize na7ay baggara nuus hyarii inggide aadho keehatitsita bonchchinttode fana yinno oochchida.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Al77o na7ay E aadho keehatitsitin dammatitsiti fana E suutsite wozintte denggida, izan nu nagartti atotitsi. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Fa aadho keehatitsita cinccatitsin qofa nuus gaantsida. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Kiristtoosa baggara oochchodes kadhide E gidda yeze saza qofa nuna erisida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Qola. 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Wode wurssutsite Xoozii folodes qoppide qoftta, salon sa7a yeze medhetitsi ubba Kiristtoosara xaaxodesi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Fa qofara ubba oochchize, fa qoftti gaar tiinii faas qoppii gaddide Kiristtoosara mahi irste ekkida. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Yinnan Kiristtoosalla tiinii ufays gaddide nuunii E bonchchito galatode fanas. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Yin mahi turii qaala yinnan atotits Wonggele, si7ide mahi Kiristtoosa ammanii Geeshi Ayyaanara attaminttida. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>E bonchchitis galata maaqqade fana Xoozii faas maaqqiduntsana wozode wontsis ezii nuus qabde mahi inggida.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Yinnii gisho, Laatstsi Yesuusa yin ammanzannon geeshshuntsis ubba yeze siiqito ta si7i <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>ta woosite yinttana qoppittera yin gisho Xoozza galatizanno ashshikaaya. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Bonchcho Aday Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa, eza erize cinccatitsin qonccits ayyaana yinttis inggode gaar taanii woossane. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18-19"/>Yinnan yin wozina aafita foo7ize wode yin xeegisiti ufayssita akko fana yezakon geeshshuntsi kale yeze iriste bonchcho duretitsita akko yezako ammanzuntsis ubba aadhide E wolqqa dammatitsita akko gaar yezako yin erode fanas.<verse eid="EPH 1:18-19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20-21"/>Kiristtoosa hyayqoppa dentside, hyalaqatitsi, adetitsi wolqqa, wolqqa, laatstsetitsi ubbappa dhoqqa, hyanna alamite xalaala baayzin ye7ode alamite mahi xeeginttode suntsappa dhoqqa, salo Xoozappa mizaqi zalar bettitside Kiristtoosa oochchide E mintsii wolqqito qonccizane. <verse eid="EPH 1:20-21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Xoozii ubbanno Kiristtoosa tohitippa oomora hyaarizida; mahi woosa keetstsis ubba omma maaqqade fana eza shuumida. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Woosa keetsita Kiristtoosa kumutsi oochchize E galla. Woosa keetsita E galla ubba bazi mulo kumide E kumutsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Maz. 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:22-23">Qola. 1:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:18">1:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosara hyayqoppa de7o fingge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Hyannippa zaga yin, yin nagarttippan yin qohitippa denddii ayyaana de7ite hyayqqiduntsana. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Yinnippa denddii yin hyanna alame iita ogito kaallida. Baqolla afa yeze ayyaanuntsi wolqqara ahizes kiitinttane, ezin kiitinttoose asuntsalla oochchize tuna ayyaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Qola. 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Nu ubbuntsi zaga yentsi asunts gidda nu asho amora nu wozina qoftto kaallii yene. Mellunts fana nu medhite Xoozze hyanqo ekkodes yezuntsana.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Yezin Xoozii fa maarotitsite dure maaqqide gisho <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>nuna kadhide damma siiqitippa dinddidanne nu qohittira hyayqqiduntsana maaqqide wode Kiristtoosara de7o inggida. E aadho keehatitsite attida. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Xoozii nuna Kiristtoosara baggara hyayqoppa dentsii salo bessa eera wolla gaddida. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>E yinno oochchidanna, Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggara nuus qonccide fa keehatitsiton likke baayze fa aadho keehatitsi duretitsito yo7ode bere nuna beezodes. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Aadho keehatitsita ammanora ashshida. Yinnan, Xoozze imo fattin yinttappa baaya. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Oonin ceeqinttaame fana oochara baaya. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Nuunii Xoozze medho; E nuus tiinii giigizii gaddide lo77o oocha oochchode fana Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara kille medhinttida.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosara yeze fettetitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Yinnii gisho, yin yelinttera Ayhude maaqqoosuntso, ashora kushera garrazinttiduntsi kale, garrazinttikaaya ga7inttezuntso, yinno qoppote. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Ye wode yin Kiristtoosappa shaakkintti yezida, Isra7eele asuntsis allaga maaqqii yezida, Xoozze ufays qaalappa hyaakkii yezidannon hyanna alamtti ufayssin Xoozii baayzin yezuntsana qoppote. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Yezin yin zaga hyaakkii yezuntsana, hyatte Kiristtoos Yesuusa yeze Kiristtoosa suutsite kale shiiqida.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Kiristtoosa nuus saro; E Ayhuden Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana fetto mahi, lam77i shaakkii gaddide morkketitsi doche lalida. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Lam77i worzhuntsappa E faara yessade fana fettii kille asi medhdhodes, higge kiitton wogito fa ashite dhabsi saro inggida. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Kiristtoosa masqalalla hyayqqii morkketitsito dhabsida; mahi lam77i zaruntsana fettii asi mahi Xoozara giigizida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Qola. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Kiristtoosa yi7i, Xoozappa hyaakkii yeze yinttisin, mahi ukke yeze Ayhuduntsis sarotits Wonggele ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Qola. 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Nu ubba E baggara fettii Ayyaanara Aday tiino shiiqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa. 57:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Yikkeppa yin zaqqon bete asi baaya, yezin yin hyatte geeshshuntsara gade asin Xoozze kara asi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Yin hawaaruntsin nabuntsi baaside baasalla keexinttida. Doche xapho mintsize shuchchize Kiristtoos Yesuusa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Eella keetsita ubba aykinttii Laatstse gidda geeshi Xoozze keetstsi maaqqade wontsis dammane. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Eera yin mahi Xoozzes aqize keetstsi maaqqii Ayyaanara wolalla keexinttoda.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis hawaare maaqqide Phawuloosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Yinnii gisho, taanii, Phawuloosa, Ayhude maaqqoosse yin gisho Kiristtoos Yesuusa achi asi maaqqida. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Yinttis tana inggide Xoozze aadho keehatitsi asttamaare ta maaqqezanno yin loytsii si7ida. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Ta yinttis zaga hyaatara xaafidanni fana Xoozii fa saza qofa taas qonccitsara erisida. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Ta xaafidanno yin nabbabize wode Kiristtoosa saza qofa ta akko gaar akaakezako yin be7ades dandda7ane. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Yinna saza qoftta Xoozze Ayyaanara geeshi hawaaruntsisin nabuntsis hyatte qonccidanni fana zaga wode asuntsis yinnii gaar qonccizikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">Qola. 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Yinnan beezanna Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi Isra7eeluntsara fettilla Xoozze anjjo laattodes fettii asatitsi billite maaqqii; Xoozii inggize ufays Wonggele baggara Yesuus Kiristtoosara shaakkinttizuntsana maaqqades.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Xoozze fa wolqqa oochara fa inggide aadho keehatitsiti imo baggara Wonggele oochchizaya maaqqida. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Taanii geeshshunts ubbappa laafa maaqqikon Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis wuzula baayze Kiristtoosa duretitsi Wonggele ohode gaar aadho keehatitsi taas ingginttida. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Mahi zaga wode ubba medhdhide Xoozara aachintti yeze saza qofa, Xoozze qoftta akko yezako qonccissades aadho keehatitsi taas ingginttida. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Xoozii yinno oochchide hyatte wode woosa keetstsi asunts baggara salo yeze hyalaquntsisin ahizuntsis fa dumma dumma qonccitsito erisodes. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Yinnan Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara nu Laatstse folide medhina qofa. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Nu Kiristtoosas maaqqidanniran eza ammandanni gaara Xoozze tiino miinggi ammaninttii shiiqodes dandda7ane.<verse eid="EPH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Taanii yin gisho madha ekkizanna nuus bonchcho yinnii gisho ta yellize madhito bi7i ufays gachchifete ga7i yinttana woossane.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efesoone asuntsis woosside woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Taanii Aday tiino bunqqunttii woossize hyannii gishosi. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Salo sa7a yeze fettii fettii kara asuntsi turii suntsi denggize Xoozappa. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Xoozii fa bonchcho duretitsappa yin gaatsa qoftto mintsize wolqqa fa ayyaana baggara inggode gaar yinttis woossane. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Mahi ammanora Kiristtoosa yin wozintte yessade gaaran yin siiqora xapho dakkii miinggi yessade gaar woossane. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Yinnii fana, Kiristtoosa siiqo akko gaar dalgga, pharggo, dhoqqin ciimmo yezako geeshshunts ubbuntsara akaakii erode gaar woossane. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Yinna as Eratitsappa dhoqqa maaqqide Kiristtoosa siiqo yin erode gaaran Xoozze folo kumutsi yin kumode fana ta woossane.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Yikke, nu gidda oochchize wolqqiti baggara nuunii woossizannippa woy qoppizannippa ubba aatsii oochchodes dandda7izes, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Eesin woosa keetstsa asuntsis ubba Kiristtoos Yesuusa wode ubba medhippa medhina yellodes bonchcho maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosara yeze fettetitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Yikke, Laatstses acinttide taanii, yin xeeginttide xeegisite beezize de7or yessade fana woossane. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Siiqora fetay fetaya dandda7itera ubba wode aadatitsaran dalggatitsara wol dandda7i yezote. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Sarotitsara acinttide ayyaana fettetitsi naagodes minggote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Qola. 3:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Yin xeeginttidanna fettii ufays xeegitsi maaqqide gisho fettii asatetsin fettii Ayyaana yene. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Fettii Laatstsii, fettii ammanon fettii xinqqate yene. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Ubbannippa dhoqqa maaqqide, ubballa oochchize ubba bessa yeze fettii Xoozii, ubbuntsi aday yene.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Yezin Kiristtoosa inggodes koydanni fana nuus fetes fetes dumma dumma imotitsi inggida. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozze qaaltte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«E ude kezide wode di7inttodes yezuntsana di7ida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">asuntsisin imotitsi inggida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EPH 4:8">yagayda. <verse eid="EPH 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Sulle sa7a oomo wodhdhida ga7e maaqqanxiko yinna «Ude kezida» gaazanna akko ga7e?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Maz. 68:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Ye sulle wodhdhiday, mahi ubbanne benttode wontsis salo ubbas kattar keziday eza.<verse eid="EPH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>E feta feta hawaaruntsana, feta feta nabe, Wonggele sabaakuntsana, woosa keetsi yenggizuntsanan, asttamaaruntsana mahi inggida. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>E yinno oochchidanna Kiristtoosa galla maaqqide woosa keetsita geeshshade fanan ammanze asuntsana Xoozze oochas giigisades. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Yinnii fana, nu ubba Xoozze na7a erii ammanora benttize fettetitsago yellii, Kiristtoosa folon kumutsi maaqqide fana nuunin kumutsi as maaqqade fanas.<verse eid="EPH 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Yikkeppa suuba, asuntsi gene cimora giigide balitsize worddo timirtte baqoran zulunttera goden hyankka sholale kaa7ize na7untsi fana maaqqodes beezoos. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Yezin nuunii turo siiqora aytsitsii ubba bazara eego omma maaqqide Kiristtoosago dichchoda. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Eeppa denddii galla ubba billite wogara oochchode fana acinttide galla xapho shazhara aykkinttii fana siiqora keexitera fa galtto dichchane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Qola. 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtooara kille de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Yikkeppa qofa baayze Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts fana yezippete ga7i Laatstse tiino markkidhane. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Un qoftta dhumida; fa wozintte dhumida. Xoozii inggize de7oppan hyaakkida. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Un yeella gaazebaz eroos; un tuna baz oochchodesin asho amotitsis fana aatsii inggida.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Yin Kiristtoosa baz yinnii gaar tamaarikaaya. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Turippa yin si7ida. Mahi Yesuusa gidda turii yezanno tamaarida. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Yin tiino yezide wogito ashshote. Mahi cimmize ammora dhabize yin gal77a qoftto hyaasote. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Yin wozina ayyaanara killidhdhote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Qola. 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Turii xillotitsaran geeshshatitsara Xoozii aazii medhinttide kille asatitsito ma77ote.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Yikke, worddo ohinttippete. Nuunii ubbuntsi Kiristtoosa galla billite maaqqide gisho as ubbara turo ohinttote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medho 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Qola. 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Kaccote, yezin yin nagara oochchippete. Yin kachchara yezin awa gelippe. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Xalahes bessi inggifete. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Kaystize yikkeppa kaystippe. Yezin dahuntsana maaddize baz yessade fana fa kushera lo77o baz oochcho.<verse eid="EPH 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Yin doonttippa mulon iita qaala kezippe. Yezin si7izuntsana ufaysodesin mintsodes beezize lo77o qaala yin doonttippa kezo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Wozo qammas attamii gaddide geeshi Xoozze ayyaana azzantsifete. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Morkketitsi, zhilo, kachchi, uufo, cashshin iita ubba yinttappa hyaasote. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Aatsii fetay fetays keehan yiqsinttizuntsana maaqqote. Xoozii Kiristtoosa baggara yinttis atto gaydanni fana yinttin wolis atto ga7ote.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Yikke, Xoozii kadhinttide na7unts fana Xoozza kaallizuntsana maaqqote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Qola. 3:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Kiristtoosa nuna kadhii Xoozza ufaysize lo77o sawize imon zharsho mahi fa shemppito nuus aatsii inggidanni fana yinttin siiqora yezote.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Akkon olale hyantta, woy tunatitsi, woy amotitsi gaarize baz mulon yin kale sinttippe. Yinna geeshi maaqqide Xooz asis beezoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Keze 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Maz. 40:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Yeellize bazin booza ohe woy qidhe yinttis beezoosse gisho yezippete; aadhii Xooz galatote fattin. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Hyanno erote; oonin olale hyanttize woy tuna baz oochchize woy amodhdhizen eeqa goynizen zhaaridhize Kiristtoosara Xoozze ka7itumo gelodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Yinnippa denddidanne Xoozze hyanqo kiitinttoose asuntsalla afa ye7ode gisho oonin yinttana fatstsoosse ohera cimmippe. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Yikke yentsesara wolla iita baz oochchizuntsana maaqqippete. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Zaga yin dhuma yezida, yezin hyatte Laatstse baggara foo7o yene. Yikke, foo7o yeze asi fana hyanttote. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Lo77otitsi ubba, xillotitsin turii aafe benttize foo7o gidda.<verse eid="EPH 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Yinnii gisho Laatstsa ufayssize baz oochchodes koyote. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Aafe baayze dhuma oochara fetto maaqqippete, aatsii qonccizote. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Un aachicha oochchize gisho melle atto yezin ohodesin yeellizane. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Yezin ubba bazi foo7o kezize wode qonccii benttane. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Qonccii benttize ubba foo7o. Yinnii gisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Naate genttizayo barkko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">hyayqoppa denddo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Kiristtoosa nees foo7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Yikke, yin cinccuntsi fana maaqqote fattin cinccatitsi baayzuntsi fana maaqqii yezaame fana loytsii naaginttote. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Qammita iita maaqqide gisho wodito wozote. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Yinnii gisho, Laatstse qoftta akko yezako qoppote fattin eeyuntsana maaqqippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Qola. 4:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Geeshi Ayyaanara kumote fattin woyne ushshara matsintifete, yinna dhabssego kanggane. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mazmureran, sabara ayyaana yetstsara, fetay fetayra ohinttote. Mahi yin wozintte zammariteran sabbitera Laatstsa galatote. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsite ubba bazis Xoozza Adaya ubba wode galatote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Qola. 3:16-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Kiristtoosa bonchchos ga7i yinttappa fetay fetays aqote.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azini bazin machchi baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Machchuntso, Laatstsis aqizanni fana yin azinuntsis aqote. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Kiristtoosa woosa keetsitis omma maaqqidanni gaar azinin fa machchitis omma. Mahi Kiristtoosa fa galla maaqqide woosa keetsito ashshiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Qola. 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Phex. 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Yezin woosa keetstsi asuntsi Kiristtoosas aqizanni fana machchuntsi fa azinuntsis ubba bazara hyaarnttote.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Azinuntso, Kiristtoosa woosa keetsito kadhii fana iis inggidanni fana yinttin yin machchuntsana kadhote. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>E woosa keetsito fa qaaltti baggara hyaatsara meeccize fana geeshane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Qola. 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Phex. 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Dhoha woy sino tukke woy yinnii gaarize baz baayze geeshin bore baayzanno mahi bonchchinttide woosa keetsito faas shiishodes koyi yinno oochchida. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Yinnii fana, azinuntsii fana kadhizanni gaara fa machchuntsana kadhodes beezane. Fa machchito kadhize fana kadhane. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Fana ixxize asi oonin baaya, yezin Kiristtoosa woosa keetsis oochchizannin naagizanni fana fa galtto muuzanen naagane. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa asatitsiti billite.<verse eid="EPH 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>«Yinnii gisho, asi fa adayan fa intto ashshii, fa machchitira fetto maaqqane; un lam77untsi fettii asho maaqqane» yagayda. <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Yinna damma saza qoftta, yezin taanii yinno Kiristtoosasin woosa keetsis aazize mahi ohine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medho 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Yezin, yin fetay fetay yin machchuntsana yinnii fana kadhote. Machchitan fa azinza bonchcho.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Na7unts bazin yelidunts bazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Na7untso, yinttana yeliduntsis Laatstse gisho ga7i kiitinttote, Yinna beezize bazi. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>«Ne adayan ne intto bonchcho.» Yinna ufays qaala yeze tiino kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Qola. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>«Ne yinno oochchiko ubba bazi nees giigoda; ne berita sa7alla pharggoda».<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Keze 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Mahe 5:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Aduntso, yin na7untsana Laatstse zoreran seerera dichchote fattin unttana zhilizippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Qola. 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstsuntsi bazin aruntsi baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Aruntso, yin Kiristtoosas kiitinttizanni fana zhashmoran goqera, yin wozintte suuritera ashos laatstsii maaqqiduntsis kiitinttote. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>As tiino saba denggodes un be7ize wode xalaala oochchifite. Yezin Xoozze qofa oochchize Kiristtoosa aruntsana maaqqote. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Asis maaqqikaayzin Laatstsis ga7i yin kumits wozinttippa oochchote. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Aro maaqqin woy laatstsii maaqqin fetay fetay fa oochchide lo77o oochitis laatstsappa anjjo kushe ekkodanno erote.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Yin laatstsuntso, manddizanno ashshii lo77o baz oochchote, yinttanan unttanan ahize Laatstsay, salo yezay as sino bi7i firdda deshshi yizoosanno yin erane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:1">Qola. 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Mahe 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Qola. 3:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze ola miishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Attidanne, Laatstsaran E damma wolqqite miinggiduntsana maaqqote. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Xalahe cimo ixxii dandda7ode gaar Xoozze yinttis inggide ola miishe ubba ma77ote. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Nu olinttizanna suutsaran ashora baaya; salo yeze tuna ayyaana olanchchuntsara; adetits wolqqa aduntsara, hyalaquntsaran hyanna dhuma alamito ahizuntsara.<verse eid="EPH 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Yinnii gisho, iita qamma ixxodes ubbanno folii, miinggi eqqodes yin dandda7ode gaar Xoozze ola miishe ubba ma77ote. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14-15"/>Yikke yin qazintte turotitsi danccii, xillotitsi xurure ma77i; sarotitsi Wonggelera giiginttii yin tohite caamma fana aatsii miinggi eqqote. <verse eid="EPH 6:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Ubbannilla gujjii, Xalahe dakkize iita lobize tama dongge ubba dhabsodes dandda7ize ammano gonddalle dentstsote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:7">52:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Atotitsi biraata barnneexa gaar yin ommite gaddote; ayyaana mashsha aykkote; ezin Xoozze qaala. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Woosaran melluntsis woosara ubba wode Ayyaanara woossote. Yinna qoftira geeshshuntsis woosittera ubba wode minggote.<figure style="fig" alt="Roman soldier in armor" file="LB00196B.TIF" size="span" ref="6:18">Roome Wottaadare Toorara </figure><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Taanii Wonggele gaatsi qofa qonccizi ohode fana Xoozii taas qaala inggode fana woossote. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Wonggele kiitas santsalaatara acinttiday E gisho ohodes beezize fana qonccizi ohode fana taas woossote.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi saritse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Taanii wayze yezakon akko oochchizako yin erode gaar nu siiqo ishay, Laatstse oochite ammninttide oochanchchizay, Tikiqoosa, ta baz ubba yinttis ohoda. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Nu baz yin erode fanan yin wozintto mintsitsode gaar yinttago kiittidanna yinnii gishos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Hawa. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Ximo. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Qola. 4:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Xoozze adeppa, Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa sarotitsin siiqo ammanora wolla ammanze ubbuntsis maaqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Medho 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Toyoosse siiqon Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa kadhize ubbuntsis aadho keehatitsi maaqqe; Amin77e.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
